{"n":90,"name":"Al-Balad","nameAr":"البلد","meaning":"The City","ayahs":20,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":30,"ar":"لَآ أُقْسِمُ بِهَـٰذَا ٱلْبَلَدِ","en":"I swear by this city [i.e., Makkah]","w":[{"ar":"لَآ","tr":"lā","en":"Nay"},{"ar":"أُقْسِمُ","tr":"uq'simu","en":"I swear","root":"قسم","lem":"أَقْسَمُ"},{"ar":"بِهَـٰذَا","tr":"bihādhā","en":"by this"},{"ar":"ٱلْبَلَدِ","tr":"l-baladi","en":"city","root":"بلد","lem":"بَلَد"}]},{"n":2,"juz":30,"ar":"وَأَنتَ حِلٌّۢ بِهَـٰذَا ٱلْبَلَدِ","en":"And you, [O Muḥammad], are free of restriction in this city","w":[{"ar":"وَأَنتَ","tr":"wa-anta","en":"And you"},{"ar":"حِلٌّۢ","tr":"ḥillun","en":"(are) free (to dwell)","root":"حلل","lem":"حِلّ"},{"ar":"بِهَـٰذَا","tr":"bihādhā","en":"in this"},{"ar":"ٱلْبَلَدِ","tr":"l-baladi","en":"city","root":"بلد","lem":"بَلَد"}]},{"n":3,"juz":30,"ar":"وَوَالِدٍ وَمَا وَلَدَ","en":"And [by] the father and that which was born [of him],","w":[{"ar":"وَوَالِدٍۢ","tr":"wawālidin","en":"And the begetter","root":"ولد","lem":"والِد"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and what"},{"ar":"وَلَدَ","tr":"walada","en":"he begot","root":"ولد","lem":"وَلَدَ"}]},{"n":4,"juz":30,"ar":"لَقَدْ خَلَقْنَا ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ فِى كَبَدٍ","en":"We have certainly created man into hardship.","w":[{"ar":"لَقَدْ","tr":"laqad","en":"Certainly"},{"ar":"خَلَقْنَا","tr":"khalaqnā","en":"We have created","root":"خلق","lem":"خَلَقَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","tr":"l-insāna","en":"man","root":"أنس","lem":"إِنسان"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"(to be) in"},{"ar":"كَبَدٍ","tr":"kabadin","en":"hardship","root":"كبد","lem":"كَبَد"}]},{"n":5,"juz":30,"ar":"أَيَحْسَبُ أَن لَّن يَقْدِرَ عَلَيْهِ أَحَدٌ","en":"Does he think that never will anyone overcome him?","w":[{"ar":"أَيَحْسَبُ","tr":"ayaḥsabu","en":"Does he think","root":"حسب","lem":"حَسِبَ"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"that"},{"ar":"لَّن","tr":"lan","en":"not"},{"ar":"يَقْدِرَ","tr":"yaqdira","en":"has power","root":"قدر","lem":"قَدَرَ"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","tr":"ʿalayhi","en":"over him"},{"ar":"أَحَدٌۭ","tr":"aḥadun","en":"anyone","root":"أحد","lem":"أَحَد"}]},{"n":6,"juz":30,"ar":"يَقُولُ أَهْلَكْتُ مَالًا لُّبَدًا","en":"He says, \"I have spent wealth in abundance.\"","w":[{"ar":"يَقُولُ","tr":"yaqūlu","en":"He will say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"أَهْلَكْتُ","tr":"ahlaktu","en":"I have squandered","root":"هلك","lem":"أَهْلَكَ"},{"ar":"مَالًۭا","tr":"mālan","en":"wealth","root":"مول","lem":"مال"},{"ar":"لُّبَدًا","tr":"lubadan","en":"abundant","root":"لبد","lem":"لُبَد"}]},{"n":7,"juz":30,"ar":"أَيَحْسَبُ أَن لَّمْ يَرَهُۥٓ أَحَدٌ","en":"Does he think that no one has seen him?","w":[{"ar":"أَيَحْسَبُ","tr":"ayaḥsabu","en":"Does he think","root":"حسب","lem":"حَسِبَ"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"that"},{"ar":"لَّمْ","tr":"lam","en":"not"},{"ar":"يَرَهُۥٓ","tr":"yarahu","en":"sees him","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"أَحَدٌ","tr":"aḥadun","en":"anyone","root":"أحد","lem":"أَحَد"}]},{"n":8,"juz":30,"ar":"أَلَمْ نَجْعَل لَّهُۥ عَيْنَيْنِ","en":"Have We not made for him two eyes?","w":[{"ar":"أَلَمْ","tr":"alam","en":"Have not"},{"ar":"نَجْعَل","tr":"najʿal","en":"We made","root":"جعل","lem":"جَعَلَ"},{"ar":"لَّهُۥ","tr":"lahu","en":"for him"},{"ar":"عَيْنَيْنِ","tr":"ʿaynayni","en":"two eyes","root":"عين","lem":"عَيْن"}]},{"n":9,"juz":30,"ar":"وَلِسَانًا وَشَفَتَيْنِ","en":"And a tongue and two lips?","w":[{"ar":"وَلِسَانًۭا","tr":"walisānan","en":"And a tongue","root":"لسن","lem":"لِسان"},{"ar":"وَشَفَتَيْنِ","tr":"washafatayni","en":"and two lips","root":"شفه","lem":"شَفَتَيْن"}]},{"n":10,"juz":30,"ar":"وَهَدَيْنَـٰهُ ٱلنَّجْدَيْنِ","en":"And have shown him the two ways?","w":[{"ar":"وَهَدَيْنَـٰهُ","tr":"wahadaynāhu","en":"And shown him","root":"هدي","lem":"هَدَى"},{"ar":"ٱلنَّجْدَيْنِ","tr":"l-najdayni","en":"the two ways","root":"نجد","lem":"نَجْدَيْن"}]},{"n":11,"juz":30,"ar":"فَلَا ٱقْتَحَمَ ٱلْعَقَبَةَ","en":"But he has not broken through the difficult pass.","w":[{"ar":"فَلَا","tr":"falā","en":"But not"},{"ar":"ٱقْتَحَمَ","tr":"iq'taḥama","en":"he has attempted","root":"قحم","lem":"اقْتَحَمَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَقَبَةَ","tr":"l-ʿaqabata","en":"the steep path","root":"عقب","lem":"عَقَبَة"}]},{"n":12,"juz":30,"ar":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْعَقَبَةُ","en":"And what can make you know what is [breaking through] the difficult pass?","w":[{"ar":"وَمَآ","tr":"wamā","en":"And what"},{"ar":"أَدْرَىٰكَ","tr":"adrāka","en":"can make you know","root":"دري","lem":"أَدْرَى"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَقَبَةُ","tr":"l-ʿaqabatu","en":"the steep path (is)","root":"عقب","lem":"عَقَبَة"}]},{"n":13,"juz":30,"ar":"فَكُّ رَقَبَةٍ","en":"It is the freeing of a slave","w":[{"ar":"فَكُّ","tr":"fakku","en":"(It is) freeing","root":"فكك","lem":"فَكّ"},{"ar":"رَقَبَةٍ","tr":"raqabatin","en":"a neck","root":"رقب","lem":"رَقَبَة"}]},{"n":14,"juz":30,"ar":"أَوْ إِطْعَـٰمٌ فِى يَوْمٍ ذِى مَسْغَبَةٍ","en":"Or feeding on a day of severe hunger","w":[{"ar":"أَوْ","tr":"aw","en":"Or"},{"ar":"إِطْعَـٰمٌۭ","tr":"iṭ'ʿāmun","en":"feeding","root":"طعم","lem":"إِطْعام"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"يَوْمٍۢ","tr":"yawmin","en":"a day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"ذِى","tr":"dhī","en":"of"},{"ar":"مَسْغَبَةٍۢ","tr":"masghabatin","en":"severe hunger","root":"سغب","lem":"مَسْغَبَة"}]},{"n":15,"juz":30,"ar":"يَتِيمًا ذَا مَقْرَبَةٍ","en":"An orphan of near relationship","w":[{"ar":"يَتِيمًۭا","tr":"yatīman","en":"An orphan","root":"يتم","lem":"يَتِيم"},{"ar":"ذَا","tr":"dhā","en":"of"},{"ar":"مَقْرَبَةٍ","tr":"maqrabatin","en":"near relationship","root":"قرب","lem":"مَقْرَبَة"}]},{"n":16,"juz":30,"ar":"أَوْ مِسْكِينًا ذَا مَتْرَبَةٍ","en":"Or a needy person in misery","w":[{"ar":"أَوْ","tr":"aw","en":"Or"},{"ar":"مِسْكِينًۭا","tr":"mis'kīnan","en":"a needy person","root":"سكن","lem":"مِسْكِين"},{"ar":"ذَا","tr":"dhā","en":"in"},{"ar":"مَتْرَبَةٍۢ","tr":"matrabatin","en":"misery","root":"ترب","lem":"مَتْرَبَة"}]},{"n":17,"juz":30,"ar":"ثُمَّ كَانَ مِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَتَوَاصَوْا۟ بِٱلصَّبْرِ وَتَوَاصَوْا۟ بِٱلْمَرْحَمَةِ","en":"And then being among those who believed and advised one another to patience and advised one another to compassion.","w":[{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"Then"},{"ar":"كَانَ","tr":"kāna","en":"he is","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"مِنَ","tr":"mina","en":"of"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"those who"},{"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","tr":"āmanū","en":"believe","root":"أمن","lem":"آمَنَ"},{"ar":"وَتَوَاصَوْا۟","tr":"watawāṣaw","en":"and enjoin (each other)","root":"وصي","lem":"تَواصَ"},{"ar":"بِٱلصَّبْرِ","tr":"bil-ṣabri","en":"to patience","root":"صبر","lem":"صَبْر"},{"ar":"وَتَوَاصَوْا۟","tr":"watawāṣaw","en":"and enjoin (each other)","root":"وصي","lem":"تَواصَ"},{"ar":"بِٱلْمَرْحَمَةِ","tr":"bil-marḥamati","en":"to compassion","root":"رحم","lem":"مَرْحَمَة"}]},{"n":18,"juz":30,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلْمَيْمَنَةِ","en":"Those are the companions of the right.","w":[{"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","tr":"ulāika","en":"Those"},{"ar":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","tr":"aṣḥābu","en":"(are the) companions","root":"صحب","lem":"أَصْحاب"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَيْمَنَةِ","tr":"l-maymanati","en":"(of) the right (hand)","root":"يمن","lem":"مَيْمَنَة"}]},{"n":19,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا هُمْ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلْمَشْـَٔمَةِ","en":"But they who disbelieved in Our signs - those are the companions of the left.","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"wa-alladhīna","en":"But those who"},{"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","tr":"kafarū","en":"disbelieve","root":"كفر","lem":"كَفَرَ"},{"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","tr":"biāyātinā","en":"in Our Verses","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"هُمْ","tr":"hum","en":"they"},{"ar":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","tr":"aṣḥābu","en":"(are the) companions","root":"صحب","lem":"أَصْحاب"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَشْـَٔمَةِ","tr":"l-mashamati","en":"(of) the left (hand)","root":"شأم","lem":"مَشْأَمَة"}]},{"n":20,"juz":30,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ نَارٌ مُّؤْصَدَةٌۢ","en":"Over them will be fire closed in.","w":[{"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","tr":"ʿalayhim","en":"Over them"},{"ar":"نَارٌۭ","tr":"nārun","en":"(will be the) Fire","root":"نور","lem":"نار"},{"ar":"مُّؤْصَدَةٌۢ","tr":"mu'ṣadatun","en":"closed in","root":"وصد","lem":"مُؤْصَدَة"}]}]}